{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37706","headline":"水 · 郑谷","name":"水","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竹院松廊分数派，不空清泚亦逶迤。\n落花相逐去何处，幽鹭独来无限时。\n洗鉢老僧临岸久，钓鱼闲客卷纶迟。\n晚晴一片连莎绿，悔与沧浪有旧期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37706.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37706","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}